        },
        {
          "text": " Kokau kanun kobu akirot naka EJAKAIT mama ejai Aburam kotoma otapo, kinera ebe, “Sirikiyoŋ, Aburam: Eoŋ ekonibuku ka ekoniropit loepol noi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala Aburam ebe, “Wu EJAKAIT Edeke, kiinakini inyo naarai alosi komamei ikoku, konye loirumi ekatogo ŋes ca Damasek Elieser?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala Aburam ebe, “Koany, mam kiinakinit eoŋ aur: ido koany, loaurikinio togoka ŋes ekerumanika,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
